Package: countryriskindex
Title: Country Health Risk Calculation
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Andrea", "Pedot", , "andrea.pedot@unimi.it", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7050-1378"))
Description: countryriskindex is an R package for computing the Country
    Health Risk Index (CHRI), a composite indicator designed to assess
    national health risks by integrating multiple dimensions of public
    health vulnerability.
